# Rail-optimized 2048-GPU fabric (8 Scalable Units), 2-tier leaf-spine.
# 256 servers x 8 GPUs; 8 rails, each served by 8 leaves (32 servers each)
# => 64 leaves of 32 down + 32 up (64-port, Quantum-2 class), 32 spines of radix 64.
# This is the LARGEST rail cluster still buildable in 2 tiers with 64-port switches
# (64 leaves x 32 downlinks = 2048 endpoints is the hard ceiling).
Nodes 2048
Tiers 2
Podsize 2048
Rails 8

Tier 0
Oversubscribed 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 200
Radix_Down 32
Radix_Up 32
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 200
Radix_Down 64
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Bundle 1
